# This is a bun repo — package.json scripts say `bun run build`, and the README says so.
# Cloudflare Pages picks its package manager by which lockfile it finds, so committing an
# npm or yarn lockfile would silently switch the builder without anything else changing.
# Running npm locally is fine; committing what it leaves behind is not.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
